# Sibling-type resolution at the shell root relies on this explicit index;
# a directory carrying a qmldir is no longer implicitly scanned, so every
# root-level type must be listed. qmldir.test.cjs enforces that.
#
# shell.qml is deliberately absent: it is the entry point Quickshell loads
# by path, and a lowercase basename cannot be a QML type name.
LauncherView LauncherView.qml
LauncherWindow LauncherWindow.qml
NotificationToasts NotificationToasts.qml
OsdWindow OsdWindow.qml
PowerMenu PowerMenu.qml
ShortcutsOverlay ShortcutsOverlay.qml
